sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Player
    participant UI as Person 1 pages
    participant API as Person 3 backend
    participant Game as Person 2 live state
    participant DB as Database
    Note over User,DB: Login and dashboard
    User->>UI: Enter email and password
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login
    API->>DB: Read user and check password securely
    API->>DB: Save session
    API-->>UI: 200 safe user summary and secure cookie
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/users/me
    API->>DB: Read own safe summary
    DB-->>API: Name and total points
    API-->>UI: 200 summary
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/leaderboard
    API->>DB: Read rankings
    DB-->>API: Ranked entries
    API-->>UI: 200 entries and nextCursor
    Note over User,DB: Read a match after a page refresh
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/matches/:matchId/snapshot
    API->>API: Verify session and participation
    alt Match is active
        API->>Game: Read current live state
        Game-->>API: Safe state without accepted answers
    else Match is finished
        API->>DB: Read saved final result
        DB-->>API: Final result
    end
    API-->>UI: 200 permitted snapshot
    Note over User,DB: Logout invalidates the same identity everywhere
    User->>UI: Click Logout
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/logout
    API->>DB: Revoke session
    API->>Game: Close this session's connections
    API-->>UI: 204 and clear cookie
    UI-->>User: Return to login

